<title>USA: Walnut Creek SD, Calif., won by Smith Barney.</title>
<headline>Walnut Creek SD, Calif., won by Smith Barney.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smith Barney Inc. said it won $6.500 million of Walnut Creek SD, Calif., general obligation bonds, 1995 election, Series B, with a true interest cost of 5.5190 percent.</p>
</text>
